comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-10T09:33:10.651Z",codex,"Duplicate check: fresh all-status absent/status search and complete open/in-progress lists found no owner for this incomplete SDK input case. Parent pmc-3jq8 owns membership, while pmc-j6cb owns the distinct historical schema/root compatibility fixes. Source is the local CodeRabbit review of commit 074db998d38e87bb27286ae983b73c7ca0f6eadf for PR 188."
  "2026-09-10T09:40:47.861Z",codex,"The first PM-linked full release gate failed during a temporary extension module-graph copy with a host filesystem quota error. The ordinary source gate had passed all 476 tests immediately beforehand. Live /tmp has only about 45k free inodes out of 1,048,576; preserve this failed receipt and rerun with a disk-backed temporary root instead of relaxing assertions or changing source."
  "2026-09-10T09:43:13.815Z",codex,"Terminal execution evidence: the canonical PM-linked npm run release:check passed with 476 tests, 100 percent lines/branches/functions, docstrings, production audit, package validation, generated changelog, version-derived dates and publish attestation. Using disk-backed temporary storage resolved the prior host inode/quota failure; no assertions or gate thresholds changed and the failed receipt remains in history. Both new regressions failed before the source change. Git failures remain fail-closed with root and underlying error context."
